WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.601
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.601 --> 00:00:04.003
We hope you're doing
well tonight.

00:00:04.003 --> 00:00:05.638
And now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to The News.

00:00:05.638 --> 00:00:09.375
The FDA announced today
that it will ban the sale

00:00:09.375 --> 00:00:11.311
of JUUL e-cigarettes.

00:00:11.311 --> 00:00:13.846
In related news,
some 15-year-olds

00:00:13.846 --> 00:00:18.017
just breached the Capitol.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:18.017 --> 00:00:20.419
The Supreme Court today issued
several rulings,

00:00:20.419 --> 00:00:23.589
including one that overturns a
New York state gun law

00:00:23.589 --> 00:00:25.158
restricting concealed weapons.

00:00:25.158 --> 00:00:26.859
So move over, tourists.

00:00:26.859 --> 00:00:29.462
Seriously, move over,
'cause you're gonna get shot.

00:00:29.462 --> 00:00:30.897
[ Laughter ]

00:00:30.897 --> 00:00:34.867
That's right, the Supreme Court
overturned a New York law.

00:00:34.867 --> 00:00:37.337
A New York state gun law
restricting concealed weapons,

00:00:37.337 --> 00:00:40.173
'cause, you know, when sometimes
you'll be on the "F" train

00:00:40.173 --> 00:00:43.843
in August and there's no AC.,
and then it stops

00:00:43.843 --> 00:00:45.544
in the middle of the tunnel
and the conductor

00:00:45.544 --> 00:00:46.813
doesn't announce anything.

00:00:46.813 --> 00:00:51.351
And you think to yourself, "Man,
I wish we all had guns."

00:00:51.351 --> 00:00:58.791
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.791 --> 00:01:00.927
According to a new report,
the Biden administration

00:01:00.927 --> 00:01:04.931
got in touch with Tesla for
advice on electric car policy

00:01:04.931 --> 00:01:07.533
despite President Biden's public
feud with Elon Musk.

00:01:07.533 --> 00:01:09.768
Yeah, Biden's not afraid to
hash it out

00:01:09.768 --> 00:01:11.270
with someone
he disagrees with.

00:01:11.270 --> 00:01:14.473
He still thinks he can be
friends with Mitch McConnell.

00:01:14.473 --> 00:01:17.677
Hell, just yesterday,
he had lunch with that bike.

00:01:17.677 --> 00:01:24.384
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.384 --> 00:01:26.752
I wondered all day, "How does a
bike sit at a table?"

00:01:26.752 --> 00:01:31.424
And that's -- that's the best
possible way to do it.

00:01:31.424 --> 00:01:34.694
Media mogul Rupert Murdoch
is reportedly divorcing

00:01:34.694 --> 00:01:36.662
his fourth wife,
model Jerry Hall.

00:01:36.662 --> 00:01:42.268
Wow. That's his fourth wife?
Who is his first wife, Eve?

00:01:42.268 --> 00:01:45.905
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.905 --> 00:01:47.673
Former President Trump is
reportedly

00:01:47.673 --> 00:01:49.676
planning to visit Alaska
next month.

00:01:49.676 --> 00:01:52.911
So get ready for that
stream of consciousness.

00:01:52.911 --> 00:01:56.249
[ As Trump ] "It's so good to be
in Alaska, which is not

00:01:56.249 --> 00:01:58.151
connected to the other states.

00:01:58.151 --> 00:02:00.887
Many people don't --
many people don't know that.

00:02:00.887 --> 00:02:03.422
Very, very unfair of the
mainland.

00:02:03.422 --> 00:02:06.259
The way they treat Alaska is
very unfair.

00:02:06.259 --> 00:02:10.229
It's very -- home of Juneau.
Juneau.

00:02:10.229 --> 00:02:13.299
That wacky high school girl who
got pregnant."

00:02:13.299 --> 00:02:15.668
[ Laughter ]
"She said silly words.

00:02:15.668 --> 00:02:18.471
She talks in a very --
A very silly way, Juneau.

00:02:18.471 --> 00:02:21.741
We love Juneau.
We love --

00:02:21.741 --> 00:02:24.177
And that, my friends, is
everything I know about you.

00:02:24.177 --> 00:02:26.846
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.846 --> 00:02:28.714
[ Normal voice ] The makers of
Monopoly yesterday

00:02:28.714 --> 00:02:31.450
released a Hamptons Edition of
the board game.

00:02:31.450 --> 00:02:34.253
Said residents,
"What the hell is income tax?"

00:02:34.253 --> 00:02:39.258
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.258 --> 00:02:42.495
Authorities in Oklahoma arrested
an employee at a fast-food

00:02:42.495 --> 00:02:44.530
restaurant this week
after a customer found

00:02:44.530 --> 00:02:47.700
a small bag of
crystal meth with their order,

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:50.670
when they had clearly ordered
a large!

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:54.473
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.473 --> 00:02:57.543
The U.S. Patent and Trademark
Office officially approved

00:02:57.543 --> 00:03:00.813
a request yesterday for
Ohio State University

00:03:00.813 --> 00:03:04.250
to register the word "the" in an
attempt to get

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:07.020
your dad to stop calling it
"The Facebook."

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:09.355
[ Laughter ]

00:03:09.355 --> 00:03:11.824
Finally, tomorrow is national
"Take your dog to work day,"

00:03:11.824 --> 00:03:13.359
while for people
who work from home,

00:03:13.359 --> 00:03:16.029
it's national
"Work around your cat day."

00:03:16.029 --> 00:03:17.329
[ Laughter ]

00:03:17.329 --> 00:03:19.566
And that, you guys,
was the monologue, everybody.

